{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Burakku Jakku Samurai</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Card Duels. Samurai Honor. Blackjack Tension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burakku Jakku Samurai</i> is a fast-paced, turn-based card battler that fuses the tension of blackjack with the lethal elegance of samurai duels. Set in a pixel-art reimagining of feudal Japan, every encounter is a deadly mind game\u2014where each card drawn could lead to triumph... or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/0870e2a23bc9066ed4b6f5ccb2124f06.poster.avif?t=1757005051\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/0870e2a23bc9066ed4b6f5ccb2124f06.webm?t=1757005051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lone ronin, you'll face a series of intense one-on-one battles. Harness over 20 unique abilities, master the flow of combat, and choose your moment to strike\u2014or risk everything in pursuit of the perfect hand. In this world, precision is power, and <strong>hitting exactly your ki</strong> means delivering a devastating critical blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7e76f2b30bdd30478fc9588db453d5d8.poster.avif?t=1757005051\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7e76f2b30bdd30478fc9588db453d5d8.webm?t=1757005051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7efae272c28dac06d142e38273d02cfa.poster.avif?t=1757005051\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7efae272c28dac06d142e38273d02cfa.webm?t=1757005051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for strategy lovers, indie fans, and players seeking deep yet digestible gameplay, <i>Burakku Jakku Samurai</i> offers a compact, replayable experience packed with meaningful choices and stylish action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each duel, uncover fragments of a subtle narrative about honor, redemption, and legacy\u2014told through gameplay, not exposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two fights play the same. No second chances. Only steel, spirit... and the cards you draw.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/529d3bba49b2cd3f4df41f7bd84b1dd2.avif?t=1757005051\" width=354 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784470?t=1757005051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784470?t=1757005051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com